; MACHINE INITIALIZATION
M451 ; CNC mode
G17 ; X-Y plane
G21 ; mm units
G90 ; Absolute positioning
M17 ; Enable all motors
M564 H1 S1 ; Enforce soft limits and require homing
G28 ; Home X, Y, Z axes
G28 U ; Home U axis (Brush A flow control)
G28 V ; Home V axis (Brush B flow control)
G0 Z10.000 F1200 ; Raise Z to safe height
M400 ; Wait for Z movement to complete
G92 Z10.000 ; Set Z height
M84 S0 ; No stepper timeout
; ===== AIRBRUSH SYSTEM INITIALIZATION =====
; 1. Turn off all air solenoids
M106 P2 S0 ; Brush A air off
