G4 P500 ; Wait for air to stop completely
; 2. Ensure U and V axes are at minimum position (closed)
G1 U0.000 F200.0 ; Close Brush A flow
G1 V0.000 F200.0 ; Close Brush B flow
M400 ; Wait for stepper motion to complete
; --- Tool Selection ---
T0 ; Select Tool 0 (Brush A) as the default tool
G4 P500 ; Wait for tool selection to complete
; STEPPER AND FAN CONFIGURATION:
