; - Brush B: Air=Fan3, Flow=V axis (range: 0.0-4.0mm, OFF=0.0mm, FULL ON=4.0mm)
; - Lower 20% of travel (0.0-0.8mm) is effectively OFF (dead zone)
; - U/V axis feedrate: 200 mm/min for smooth flow control
; TOOL SELECTION:
; - Tool 0 = Brush A (Primary Airbrush)
; - Tool 1 = Brush B (Secondary Airbrush)
; - Tool offsets are configured in RepRapFirmware's config.g using G10
; - Switching tools automatically applies the configured offset
; - Soft limits temporarily disabled when using Tool 1
; SAFETY MEASURES:
; - Brush activation only happens after XY positioning and Z lowering
; - Using M400 to ensure all moves complete before next action
; - Air turned on before paint to prevent dripping
; - Paint turned off before air to prevent dripping
; Z TRAVEL OPTIMIZATION:
